Apple today updated the <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/shazam-find-music-concerts/id284993459">Shazam app</a> with stickers, starting with an exclusive collection inspired by Ariana Grande's new <a href="https://music.apple.com/us/album/petal/1895420989">"petal" album</a>.<br/>
